# __FIA_DISPLAY_NAME__

This project was created with FIA Framework.

```bash
bun run dev
```

If the project was created with `--no-install`, run `bun install` first.

Open the printed loopback URL to try the React page, HTTP Hello request, and WebSocket Echo.

## Current runtime boundary

This phase 1 scaffold calls `Bun.serve` directly so it can run in a browser today. It is not yet
connected to the Swift Host bootstrap protocol, FIA session authentication, or the production
runtime lifecycle. The server entry will need to migrate to the FIA-managed runtime contract when
`fia dev`, `fia run`, and `fia build` are implemented.
